---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 8, 2026';
const supportEmail = 'hello@m8tcha.com';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - M8tcha"
  description="Terms of use for the M8tcha: Find Your People app."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="legal wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>M8tcha Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated"><strong>Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</strong></p>

    <p>
      These Terms of Service ("<strong>Terms</strong>") are a legal agreement between you and
      M8tcha, Inc. ("<strong>M8tcha</strong>," "<strong>we</strong>," "<strong>us</strong>,"
      "<strong>our</strong>") governing your use of the M8tcha: Find Your People mobile application
      and related websites and services (the "<strong>App</strong>"). By creating an account or
      using the App, you agree to these Terms and our{' '}
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the App.
    </p>
    <p>
      These Terms are intended for users in the United States and elsewhere. If you are a consumer
      in the EU/EEA or UK, mandatory consumer protections of your country of residence also apply
      and prevail over conflicting terms to the extent required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Eligibility</h2>
    <p>
      You must be at least <strong>18</strong> years old to use M8tcha. By using the App, you
      represent and warrant that:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>You are at least 18 years old and legally able to enter a binding contract;</li>
      <li>You are not barred from using the App under the laws of your jurisdiction;</li>
      <li>
        You are not a convicted sex offender, and are not using the App to harass, exploit, or harm
        others;
      </li>
      <li>All registration information you provide is accurate, current, and complete.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We may require age or identity verification at any time and may suspend or terminate accounts
      that violate this section. The App is not intended for children under 13 and is not directed
      to users under 18.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Your Account</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for
        all activity under your account.
      </li>
      <li>
        One person may maintain only one account. Impersonation, fake profiles, and bots are
        prohibited.
      </li>
      <li>
        You must notify us immediately at{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}>{supportEmail}</a>
        {' '}of any unauthorized use of your account.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. The Service</h2>
    <p>
      M8tcha is a social/dating platform that helps users discover and connect with other users
      based on profile information, preferences, and location. <strong>M8tcha does not conduct
      criminal background checks, identity verification, or screening of any kind on users</strong>,
      unless explicitly stated otherwise in-app. You are solely responsible for your interactions
      with other users, on and off the platform.
    </p>

    <h3>Safety Disclaimer</h3>
    <p>We strongly encourage you to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Meet in public places for initial in-person meetings;</li>
      <li>Tell a friend or family member where you are going;</li>
      <li>
        Never send money, gift cards, or financial information to anyone you meet on M8tcha;
      </li>
      <li>
        Report any suspicious, abusive, or inappropriate behavior immediately via the in-app report
        tool.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>M8tcha is not responsible for the conduct of any user, online or offline.</p>

    <h2>4. User Content &amp; License</h2>
    <p>
      "<strong>User Content</strong>" means any photos, videos, profile information, messages, or
      other material you submit to the App.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>You retain ownership</strong> of your User Content.</li>
      <li>
        By submitting User Content, you grant M8tcha a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free,
        sublicensable license to host, store, reproduce, display, and distribute it <strong>solely
        for the purpose of operating, promoting, and improving the App</strong> (e.g., displaying
        your profile to other users).
      </li>
      <li>
        You represent that you own or have the necessary rights to all User Content you submit, and
        that it does not infringe any third party's rights.
      </li>
      <li>
        We may remove any User Content that violates these Terms or applicable law, at our
        discretion.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Prohibited Content &amp; Conduct</h3>
    <p>You may not use M8tcha to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Post content that is sexually explicit, exploits minors, is violent, hateful, harassing, or
        discriminatory;
      </li>
      <li>
        Impersonate any person or entity, or misrepresent your identity, age, or affiliation;
      </li>
      <li>
        Solicit money, engage in scams, or promote commercial activity, including sex work
        solicitation;
      </li>
      <li>Harass, stalk, threaten, or intimidate other users;</li>
      <li>
        Upload malware, spam, or attempt to scrape, reverse-engineer, or interfere with the App;
      </li>
      <li>Violate any applicable law or third-party right.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We may investigate and take appropriate action - including content removal, warnings,
      suspension, or termination, and reporting to law enforcement - against anyone who violates
      this section.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Reporting &amp; Blocking</h2>
    <p>
      You can block or report any user directly within the App. We review reports and take action
      consistent with our Community Guidelines and applicable law, though we cannot guarantee any
      particular outcome or response time.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Subscriptions, Auto-Renewal &amp; In-App Purchases</h2>
    <p>
      If M8tcha offers paid subscriptions or in-app purchases ("<strong>Paid Features</strong>"):
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Payments may be processed through Apple's In-App Purchase system, Google Play Billing,
        and/or Stripe, and are subject to the applicable platform's terms and payment methods.
        M8tcha does not receive or store full payment card numbers when you pay through Apple or
        Google Play.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Auto-renewal:</strong> Subscriptions automatically renew at the then-current price
        for the same billing period unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the
        current period (or by the deadline stated by the billing platform). By purchasing, you
        authorize recurring charges until you cancel.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>How to cancel (U.S. / platform requirements):</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Apple: <strong>iOS Settings &gt; [Your Name] &gt; Subscriptions</strong>
          </li>
          <li>Google Play: Play Store &gt; profile &gt; Payments &amp; subscriptions</li>
          <li>Stripe / card billing: use the in-app manage subscription / customer portal flow</li>
        </ul>
        Cancellation takes effect at the end of the then-current paid period. You generally retain
        access until that period ends.
      </li>
      <li>
        Prices are displayed in the App before purchase, may vary by region/storefront, and may
        change with notice as permitted by law and platform rules.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Refunds:</strong> Apple purchases are handled by Apple
        (<a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >reportaproblem.apple.com</a
        >). Google Play refunds follow Google's policies. Stripe/card refunds follow our and
        Stripe's policies and applicable law. Nothing in these Terms limits non-waivable statutory
        refund or cooling-off rights.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      For California and other U.S. states with automatic renewal laws, we present clear
      pre-purchase disclosures of the offer terms, renewal mechanics, and cancellation instructions,
      and we obtain your affirmative consent to the automatic renewal where required.
    </p>

    <h3>EU/UK Right of Withdrawal</h3>
    <p>
      If you are a consumer in the EU/EEA or UK, you generally have a <strong>14-day right of
      withdrawal</strong> from a digital content/service purchase under the Consumer Rights Directive
