    <p>
      If you believe content on M8tcha infringes your copyright, send a notice to{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}>{supportEmail}</a>
      {' '}including: identification of the work, the infringing material's location, your contact
      information, a good-faith statement of infringement, and a statement of accuracy under penalty
      of perjury, consistent with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (17 U.S.C. §512).
    </p>

    <h2>9. Termination</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>You</strong> may delete your account at any time via{' '}
        <strong>Settings &gt; Account &gt; Delete Account</strong>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>We</strong> may suspend or terminate your account, with or without notice, if you
        violate these Terms, pose a safety risk, or for any other reason at our reasonable
        discretion, subject to applicable law.
      </li>
      <li>
        Upon termination, your right to use the App ceases immediately. Paid subscription periods
        may continue until the end of the then-current term depending on the billing platform's
        rules. Sections that by their nature should survive (e.g., Intellectual Property,
        Disclaimers, Limitation of Liability, Indemnification, Governing Law) will survive
        termination.
      </li>
    </ul>

