      injury where such limitation is prohibited, and consumers retain all statutory rights that
      cannot be waived (including under applicable U.S. state consumer protection laws and EU/UK
      consumer law).
    </p>

    <h2>11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, M8tcha, Inc. and its officers, directors, employees,
      and agents shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, exemplary,
