    </p>
    <p>
      Our total aggregate liability for any claim arising from these Terms or the App shall not
      exceed the greater of (a) the amount you paid us for Paid Features in the 12 months preceding
      the claim, or (b) USD 100. Some jurisdictions do not allow certain limitations; in those
